paragraph.math:
$$\begin{array}{l}
  {\left( {f \circ g \circ h} \right)(x) = {f\left( {g\left( {h(x)} \right)} \right) = f\left( {g\left( {x + 9} \right)} \right) = f\left( {\cos\left( {x + 9} \right)} \right)}} \\
  {\phantom{\left( {f \circ g \circ h} \right)(x)} = {\left\lbrack \cos(x + 9) \right\rbrack^{2} = F(x)}}
  \end{array}$$
